+// ff-bgm1x: 설정값을 BgmReplacer 에 적용한다 (켜고 끄기는 다음 프레임에 에뮬레이션 스레드가 적용)
+void MelonInstance::applyBgmConfiguration()
+{
+    if (!bgmReplacer || !currentConfiguration)
+        return;
+    bgmReplacer->requestEnabled(currentConfiguration->bgm1x);
+    bgmReplacer->setFastForwardCutscenes(currentConfiguration->bgm1xFastForwardCutscenes);
+    bgmReplacer->setSfx1x(currentConfiguration->bgm1xSfx);
+    bgmReplacer->setSfxVolume(currentConfiguration->bgm1xSfxVolume);
+}
+
+void MelonInstance::mixBgm(s16* buffer, int frames, int volume)
+{
+    if (bgmReplacer)
+        bgmReplacer->mixInto(buffer, frames, volume, frames);
+}
+
+bool MelonInstance::isBgmSpeedHold()
+{
+    return bgmReplacer && bgmReplacer->isEnabled() && !bgmReplacer->fastForwardCutscenes() && bgmReplacer->cutsceneActive();
 }
 
